The '''Boar Prime''' is the [[Prime]] version of the {{Weapon|Boar}}, featuring higher damage, [[critical chance]], [[critical multiplier]], [[status chance]], and [[fire rate]]. It was released alongside {{WF|Mag Prime}} and {{Weapon|Dakra Prime}}.

==Characteristics==
